<% if (_status === 'created') { %>
Maintenance Request Received
=============================

Hi <%= currentuser.firstName || currentuser.email %>,

We've received your maintenance request and added it to the queue. You'll be notified once a vendor is assigned.

REQUEST DETAILS
---------------
Reference #: <%= request.mruid %>
Title:       <%= request.title %>
Category:    <%= request.category.replace(/_/g, ' ') %>
Priority:    <%= request.priority %>
Status:      Open
<% if (request.preferredDate) { %>Preferred Date: <%= new Date(request.preferredDate).toLocaleDateString() %>
<% } %><% if (request.availabilityWindows && request.availabilityWindows.length > 0) { %>Availability:   <%= request.availabilityWindows.join(', ').replace(/_/g, ' ') %>
<% } %>
Keep your reference number for follow-ups: <%= request.mruid %>
<% } else if (_status === 'assigned') { %>
New Job Assignment
==================

Hi <%= vendor.firstName || vendor.email %>,

<%= assignedBy.firstName || assignedBy.email %> has assigned you a maintenance request.
Please accept or decline within 24 hours.

JOB DETAILS
-----------
Reference #:    <%= request.mruid %>
Title:          <%= request.title %>
Description:    <%= request.description %>
Category:       <%= request.category.replace(/_/g, ' ') %>
Priority:       <%= request.priority.toUpperCase() %>
Property Entry: <%= request.permissionToEnter ? 'Permission granted' : 'Must coordinate with resident' %>
<% if (request.scheduledDate) { %>Scheduled Date: <%= new Date(request.scheduledDate).toLocaleDateString() %>
<% } %><% if (request.estimatedCost) { %>Estimated Cost: $<%= (request.estimatedCost / 100).toFixed(2) %>
<% } %><% if (request.preferredDate) { %>Resident Preferred Date: <%= new Date(request.preferredDate).toLocaleDateString() %>
<% } %><% if (request.availabilityWindows && request.availabilityWindows.length > 0) { %>Resident Availability: <%= request.availabilityWindows.join(', ').replace(/_/g, ' ') %>
<% } %>
Log in to the portal to accept or decline this assignment.

Questions? Contact <%= assignedBy.firstName || assignedBy.email %><% if (assignedBy.email) { %> at <%= assignedBy.email %><% } %>.
<% } else if (_status === 'accepted') { %>
Your Request is Being Handled
==============================

Hi <%= tenant && (tenant.firstName || tenant.email) ? (tenant.firstName || tenant.email) : 'Resident' %>,

Good news — a vendor has accepted your maintenance request and will be in touch to schedule the work.

REQUEST DETAILS
---------------
Reference #: <%= request.mruid %>
Title:       <%= request.title %>
Category:    <%= request.category.replace(/_/g, ' ') %>
Priority:    <%= request.priority.toUpperCase() %>
<% if (request.assignedTechnician && request.assignedTechnician.name) { %>Technician:  <%= request.assignedTechnician.name %><% if (request.assignedTechnician.phone) { %> — <%= request.assignedTechnician.phone %><% } %>
<% } %><% if (request.scheduledDate) { %>Scheduled:   <%= new Date(request.scheduledDate).toLocaleDateString() %>
<% } %>
You will be contacted to confirm the schedule. Please ensure access is available at the agreed time.

Log in to the resident portal to track the status of your request.
<% } else if (_status === 'declined') { %>
Vendor Declined — Reassignment Required
=========================================

A vendor has declined the maintenance request below.
The request has been returned to Open status and requires reassignment.

DETAILS
-------
Reference #: <%= request.mruid %>
Title:       <%= request.title %>
Priority:    <%= request.priority %>
Status:      Open — awaiting reassignment
<% if (reason) { %>Vendor Reason: "<%= reason %>"
<% } %>
Log in to the portal to assign a new vendor.
<% } else if (_status === 'completed') { %>
Maintenance Request Completed
==============================

Hi <%= tenant && (tenant.firstName || tenant.email) ? (tenant.firstName || tenant.email) : 'Resident' %>,

Your maintenance request has been completed. We hope everything is in order.

REQUEST SUMMARY
---------------
Reference #: <%= request.mruid %>
Title:       <%= request.title %>
Category:    <%= request.category.replace(/_/g, ' ') %>
<% if (request.completedAt) { %>Completed:   <%= new Date(request.completedAt).toLocaleDateString() %>
<% } %><% if (request.completionNotes && request.completionNotes.length > 0) { %>Notes:       <%= request.completionNotes[request.completionNotes.length - 1].note %>
<% } %>
If the issue has not been resolved or you have concerns, please contact your property manager.

Log in to the resident portal to view your request history.
<% } %>
